With respect to the priest quest and the lower levels of ghennom (sp):

The first time I tried the quest, I had genocideded all L's and V's:
This had the effect of making all the monsters in the quest and ghennom
into Z's, Wraiths and ghosts.  The next game I genocided all Z's as
well just for the hell of it (hoping to get nothing but wraiths and
				     ghosts!)
but the game didn't seem to want to give that to me...it just
started dishing out normal monsters!  :) :)  It made the lower
levels a LOT easier with respect to food.  It also works with the
ball of opening - ring it, summon 20 random monsters...there are still
a lot of wraiths, which is cool :)  It was a blast trying to do the 
priest quest with 10 bazillion random monsters coming at me - 
I slipped on the ring of conflict to watch the carnage for a few
turns heh heh heh...

Anyone else try this 'trick' with the genociding of undead?

